;; Task registry for `nbb scripts/run-task.cljs <task>` (ADR-2607173000).
;; Converted from bb.edn in ADR-2608135000.
;;
;; JVM, not nbb, and the reason is worth recording: these suites throw and catch
;; `clojure.lang.ExceptionInfo` by class name, which does not exist under nbb (it is
;; `cljs.core/ExceptionInfo` there). babashka bundles enough of the JVM shape that the
;; distinction never came up. Running them under `clojure` keeps the source untouched; making
;; them portable would mean catching :default instead, which is a source change, not a task
;; conversion.
{:test {:cmd ["clojure" "-Sdeps" "{:paths [\".\"] :deps {org.clojure/clojure {:mvn/version \"1.12.0\"}}}"
              "-M" "-e"
              "(require 'gitoffice-test 'gitdiff-test 'gitmerge-test 'gitpolicy-test)(System/exit (+ (gitoffice-test/-main) (gitdiff-test/-main) (gitmerge-test/-main) (gitpolicy-test/-main)))"]
        :doc "GitOffice Phase 0/1/3 + merge-policy gate tests (verified 2026-08-13: 8/25, 10/36 and the rest, 0 failures)."}}
